{"title":"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define a \"hook\" to be a figure made up of six unit squares as shown below in the picture, or any of the figures obtained by applying rotations and reflections to this figure.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef4cdb21baa20a696547d85c9c5773637ad93506.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(0.5 cm);  draw((0,0)--(1,0)); draw((0,1)--(1,1)); draw((2,1)--(3,1)); draw((0,2)--(3,2)); draw((0,3)--(3,3)); draw((0,0)--(0,3)); draw((1,0)--(1,3)); draw((2,1)--(2,3)); draw((3,1)--(3,3)); [/asy]\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" />\n</p><p>Determine all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/5/dc5c773a00becebf2fe78e775d5953e138efea9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\times n$\" width=\"48\" height=\"9\" /> rectangles that can be covered without gaps and without overlaps with hooks such that;\n(a) the rectangle is covered without gaps and without overlaps,\n(b) no part of a hook covers area outside the rectangle.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO\" title=\"2004 IMO\">2004 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/